# Privacy Policy — Oskar's eBay Market Report

_Last updated: 6 November 2026_

This is a personal tool used by a single eBay seller (the developer) to review the prices of their own active listings. It is not offered to the public and no other eBay users sign in to it.

## What data it accesses
- The developer's own active eBay listings (title, price, postage, quantity, listing date, watch and view counts).
- Publicly available eBay listing information (titles, prices, postage and links) used to compare market prices.

## What it does not do
- It does not access, collect or store personal information about buyers or other eBay users (no names, usernames, addresses, emails or phone numbers).
- It does not change, create or end listings. It is read-only.
- It does not sell, share or transfer any data to third parties.

## Storage and security
- Reports are saved only on the developer's own computer.
- API credentials and access tokens are stored locally in a private configuration file, are never published, and can be revoked at any time from the developer's eBay account settings.

